/ROUTINE WHICH PLOTS THE POINTS ON THE BIT MAP AND STORES
/THE BIT MAP ON DISK

	XLIST	OFF

	IFZERO 	EAE <
	/EAE SIMULATION DEFINITIONS
	 DVI=JMS I (XDVI)	/JUMP TO THE DIVIDE ROUTINE>

	XLIST	ON
DSKPLT,	.-.			/BEGIN PLOTTING POINTS ON THE BIT MAP
	CLA			/CLEAN UP
	NOP/SWBA		/WILL BE NOP WHEN SIMULATOR IS USED
