	DCA I	(YREMAIN)	/STORE THE REMAINDER
	SWP			/LOAD THE AC WITH THE MQ
	DCA I	(YQUOT)		/STORE THE QUOTIENT
	TAD 	YSPACE		/GET Y SPACING VARIABLE
